{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/c7eb07557befe769533753475764a88b.poster.avif?t=1768492156\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/c7eb07557befe769533753475764a88b.webm?t=1768492156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desktop idle game, featuring adorable cats that chill at the bottom of your screen, keeping you company while you work, study, play, or relax. Collect toys and furniture to build a cozy home for your cats. Pet them, feed them, play with them or simply enjoy their presence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with your cats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pet your cats or play with them using the toys. These interactions grant you Paw Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/d04502f78662456ac38698eeb36f9679.poster.avif?t=1768492156\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/d04502f78662456ac38698eeb36f9679.webm?t=1768492156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incremental game progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points, get upgrades, earn more points, buy toys, earn even more points and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/933b37fc16673689c5bec99d30405d45.poster.avif?t=1768492156\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/933b37fc16673689c5bec99d30405d45.webm?t=1768492156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-obstructing gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cats and items are not fixed in place. You can just drag them away if they're obstructing something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/bc41e81e0ec02026ba98823817472a8e.poster.avif?t=1768492156\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/bc41e81e0ec02026ba98823817472a8e.webm?t=1768492156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/extras/bc41e81e0ec02026ba98823817472a8e.mp4?t=1768492156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just wanna chill?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't like the gameplay? There's a chill button that removes demanding interactions. You can just enjoy having these cute feline companions at the bottom of your screen without any maintenance. Life is already complicated enough, you don't need another game to bother you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twitch Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to share the joy with your viewers? Let them interact with the cats by using !pet and !feed commands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870120?t=1768492156","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870120?t=1768492156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870120/af16b92fcef6a9382d9966672b66fbc43fd9f5c9/cap